<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>DISP — Infographie Réglementaire Européenne</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #05080F;
    --surface: #0C1220;
    --surface2: #111827;
    --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    --accent-eu: #0066CC;
    --accent-dga: #1E88E5;
    --accent-gaia: #00BFA5;
    --accent-disp: #F59E0B;
    --accent-gold: #D4A843;
    --text: #F0F4FF;
    --text-muted: #7A8AA0;
    --text-dim: #3D5068;
  }

- { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
background: var(–bg);
color: var(–text);
font-family: ‘DM Sans’, sans-serif;
min-height: 100vh;
overflow-x: hidden;
}

/* Background grid */
body::before {
content: ‘’;
position: fixed;
inset: 0;
background-image:
linear-gradient(rgba(0,102,204,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,102,204,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
background-size: 60px 60px;
pointer-events: none;
z-index: 0;
}

.wrapper {
position: relative;
z-index: 1;
max-width: 1100px;
margin: 0 auto;
padding: 60px 40px 80px;
}

/* ── HEADER ── */
.header {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
align-items: start;
gap: 40px;
margin-bottom: 64px;
padding-bottom: 40px;
border-bottom: 1px solid var(–border);
}

.eu-stars {
font-size: 11px;
letter-spacing: 6px;
color: var(–accent-gold);
text-transform: uppercase;
margin-bottom: 16px;
display: flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 8px;
}
.eu-stars::before {
content: ‘★ ★ ★ ★ ★’;
}

h1 {
font-family: ‘DM Serif Display’, serif;
font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px);
line-height: 1.05;
color: var(–text);
margin-bottom: 12px;
}

h1 span {
color: var(–accent-dga);
font-style: italic;
}

.header-sub {
font-size: 15px;
color: var(–text-muted);
max-width: 480px;
line-height: 1.6;
font-weight: 300;
}

.badge-dga {
background: rgba(30,136,229,0.12);
border: 1px solid rgba(30,136,229,0.3);
border-radius: 12px;
padding: 20px 24px;
text-align: center;
flex-shrink: 0;
min-width: 180px;
}
.badge-dga .reg {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 11px;
color: var(–accent-dga);
text-transform: uppercase;
letter-spacing: 2px;
margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.badge-dga .year {
font-family: ‘DM Serif Display’, serif;
font-size: 38px;
color: var(–text);
line-height: 1;
margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.badge-dga .label {
font-size: 11px;
color: var(–text-muted);
font-weight: 300;
}

/* ── DEFINITION BLOCK ── */
.definition {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 4px 1fr;
gap: 24px;
margin-bottom: 56px;
align-items: start;
}
.def-bar {
background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(–accent-disp), var(–accent-dga));
border-radius: 2px;
height: 100%;
min-height: 80px;
}
.def-content {}
.def-label {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 3px;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–accent-disp);
margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.def-text {
font-size: 17px;
line-height: 1.65;
color: #CBD5E1;
font-weight: 300;
}
.def-text strong {
color: var(–text);
font-weight: 500;
}

/* ── ROLES ── */
.section-title {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 4px;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–text-dim);
margin-bottom: 24px;
display: flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 16px;
}
.section-title::after {
content: ‘’;
flex: 1;
height: 1px;
background: var(–border);
}

.roles-grid {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
gap: 2px;
margin-bottom: 56px;
border-radius: 16px;
overflow: hidden;
}

.role-card {
background: var(–surface);
padding: 28px 24px;
position: relative;
transition: background 0.2s;
}
.role-card:hover { background: var(–surface2); }

.role-card::before {
content: ‘’;
position: absolute;
top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
height: 2px;
}
.role-card.holder::before { background: #6366F1; }
.role-card.disp::before { background: var(–accent-disp); }
.role-card.user::before { background: var(–accent-gaia); }

.role-icon {
width: 40px;
height: 40px;
border-radius: 10px;
display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: center;
font-size: 18px;
margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.holder .role-icon { background: rgba(99,102,241,0.15); }
.disp .role-icon { background: rgba(245,158,11,0.15); }
.user .role-icon { background: rgba(0,191,165,0.15); }

.role-name {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 2px;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–text-muted);
margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.role-title {
font-size: 16px;
font-weight: 600;
margin-bottom: 10px;
color: var(–text);
}
.role-desc {
font-size: 13px;
color: var(–text-muted);
line-height: 1.6;
font-weight: 300;
}

/* Arrow between roles */
.roles-flow {
display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: center;
gap: 0;
margin-bottom: 20px;
padding: 0 8px;
}

/* ── DGA OBLIGATIONS ── */
.obligations-grid {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
gap: 12px;
margin-bottom: 56px;
}

.obligation {
background: var(–surface);
border: 1px solid var(–border);
border-radius: 12px;
padding: 20px 22px;
display: flex;
gap: 16px;
align-items: flex-start;
transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
}
.obligation:hover {
border-color: rgba(30,136,229,0.3);
transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.ob-number {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 22px;
font-weight: 500;
color: rgba(30,136,229,0.3);
line-height: 1;
flex-shrink: 0;
padding-top: 2px;
}
.ob-title {
font-size: 13px;
font-weight: 600;
color: var(–text);
margin-bottom: 5px;
}
.ob-desc {
font-size: 12px;
color: var(–text-muted);
line-height: 1.55;
font-weight: 300;
}

/* ── REGULATORY LANDSCAPE ── */
.reg-table {
width: 100%;
border-collapse: separate;
border-spacing: 0 6px;
margin-bottom: 56px;
}
.reg-table thead th {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 2px;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–text-dim);
text-align: left;
padding: 0 20px 12px;
border-bottom: 1px solid var(–border);
}
.reg-table tbody tr {
background: var(–surface);
transition: background 0.15s;
}
.reg-table tbody tr:hover { background: var(–surface2); }

.reg-table tbody td {
padding: 16px 20px;
font-size: 13px;
vertical-align: middle;
}
.reg-table tbody td:first-child {
border-radius: 10px 0 0 10px;
}
.reg-table tbody td:last-child {
border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
color: var(–text-muted);
font-weight: 300;
line-height: 1.5;
}

.reg-name {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 12px;
font-weight: 500;
color: var(–accent-dga);
white-space: nowrap;
}
.reg-full { font-size: 12px; color: var(–text-muted); margin-top: 3px; font-weight: 300; }

.reg-tag {
display: inline-block;
padding: 3px 10px;
border-radius: 20px;
font-size: 11px;
font-weight: 500;
white-space: nowrap;
}
.tag-fondateur { background: rgba(30,136,229,0.15); color: var(–accent-dga); }
.tag-acces { background: rgba(99,102,241,0.15); color: #818CF8; }
.tag-protection { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.12); color: #F87171; }
.tag-ia { background: rgba(139,92,246,0.15); color: #A78BFA; }
.tag-cyber { background: rgba(245,158,11,0.15); color: var(–accent-disp); }
.tag-identite { background: rgba(0,191,165,0.15); color: var(–accent-gaia); }

/* ── GAIA-X SECTION ── */
.gaia-section {
background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,191,165,0.05) 0%, rgba(0,102,204,0.05) 100%);
border: 1px solid rgba(0,191,165,0.15);
border-radius: 20px;
padding: 40px;
margin-bottom: 56px;
position: relative;
overflow: hidden;
}
.gaia-section::before {
content: ‘’;
position: absolute;
top: -60px; right: -60px;
width: 240px; height: 240px;
border-radius: 50%;
background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,191,165,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
pointer-events: none;
}

.gaia-header {
display: flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 16px;
margin-bottom: 32px;
}
.gaia-logo {
width: 48px; height: 48px;
border-radius: 12px;
background: rgba(0,191,165,0.15);
border: 1px solid rgba(0,191,165,0.3);
display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
font-size: 22px;
flex-shrink: 0;
}
.gaia-header h2 {
font-family: ‘DM Serif Display’, serif;
font-size: 28px;
color: var(–text);
}
.gaia-header .sub {
font-size: 13px;
color: var(–text-muted);
font-weight: 300;
}

.gaia-grid {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
gap: 16px;
margin-bottom: 32px;
}
.gaia-card {
background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
border: 1px solid rgba(0,191,165,0.12);
border-radius: 12px;
padding: 20px;
}
.gaia-card-icon { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.gaia-card-title {
font-size: 13px;
font-weight: 600;
color: var(–text);
margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.gaia-card-desc {
font-size: 12px;
color: var(–text-muted);
line-height: 1.6;
font-weight: 300;
}

/* ── SYNERGY DIAGRAM ── */
.synergy {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
gap: 24px;
align-items: center;
margin-bottom: 56px;
}

.synergy-block {
border-radius: 16px;
padding: 28px 24px;
}
.synergy-block.dga {
background: rgba(30,136,229,0.08);
border: 1px solid rgba(30,136,229,0.2);
}
.synergy-block.gaia {
background: rgba(0,191,165,0.08);
border: 1px solid rgba(0,191,165,0.2);
}

.synergy-label {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 2px;
text-transform: uppercase;
margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.dga .synergy-label { color: var(–accent-dga); }
.gaia .synergy-label { color: var(–accent-gaia); }

.synergy-title {
font-family: ‘DM Serif Display’, serif;
font-size: 20px;
margin-bottom: 16px;
color: var(–text);
}
.synergy-list {
list-style: none;
}
.synergy-list li {
font-size: 12px;
color: var(–text-muted);
padding: 6px 0;
border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
display: flex;
gap: 10px;
font-weight: 300;
line-height: 1.5;
}
.synergy-list li::before { color: var(–accent-disp); flex-shrink: 0; }
.dga .synergy-list li::before { content: ‘—’; color: var(–accent-dga); }
.gaia .synergy-list li::before { content: ‘—’; color: var(–accent-gaia); }

.synergy-center {
display: flex;
flex-direction: column;
align-items: center;
gap: 8px;
}
.synergy-plus {
width: 56px; height: 56px;
border-radius: 50%;
background: rgba(245,158,11,0.12);
border: 2px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.3);
display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
font-size: 24px;
color: var(–accent-disp);
font-weight: 300;
}
.synergy-result {
background: rgba(245,158,11,0.1);
border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.25);
border-radius: 10px;
padding: 10px 14px;
text-align: center;
font-size: 11px;
font-weight: 500;
color: var(–accent-disp);
line-height: 1.4;
}

/* ── DATA SPACES ── */
.spaces-grid {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
gap: 8px;
margin-bottom: 56px;
}
.space-chip {
background: var(–surface);
border: 1px solid var(–border);
border-radius: 10px;
padding: 16px 12px;
text-align: center;
transition: all 0.2s;
cursor: default;
}
.space-chip:hover {
border-color: rgba(0,191,165,0.3);
transform: translateY(-3px);
}
.space-emoji { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.space-name {
font-size: 11px;
font-weight: 600;
color: var(–text);
margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.space-sector {
font-size: 10px;
color: var(–text-muted);
font-weight: 300;
}

/* ── FOOTER ── */
.footer {
border-top: 1px solid var(–border);
padding-top: 32px;
display: flex;
justify-content: space-between;
align-items: center;
flex-wrap: gap;
gap: 16px;
}
.footer-text {
font-size: 11px;
color: var(–text-dim);
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
}
.footer-tags {
display: flex;
gap: 8px;
flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.ftag {
font-size: 10px;
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
color: var(–text-dim);
border: 1px solid var(–border);
border-radius: 4px;
padding: 3px 8px;
}

/* animations */
@keyframes fadeUp {
from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
.animate {
animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease forwards;
opacity: 0;
}
.d1 { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
.d2 { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
.d3 { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
.d4 { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
.d5 { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
.d6 { animation-delay: 0.6s; }

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width: 700px) {
.wrapper { padding: 32px 20px 60px; }
.header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
.roles-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
.obligations-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
.gaia-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
.synergy { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
.synergy-center { flex-direction: row; }
.spaces-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
</style>

</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">

  <!-- HEADER -->

  <div class="header animate d1">
    <div>
      <div class="eu-stars">Union Européenne &nbsp;·&nbsp; Marché Unique des Données</div>
      <h1>DISP<br><span>Data Intermediation</span><br>Service Providers</h1>
      <p class="header-sub">Cadre réglementaire européen du partage de données & articulation avec l'écosystème Gaia-X</p>
    </div>
    <div class="badge-dga">
      <div class="reg">Règlement UE</div>
      <div class="year">2022<br>/868</div>
      <div class="label">Data Governance Act<br>En vigueur sept. 2023</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- DEFINITION -->

  <div class="definition animate d2">
    <div class="def-bar"></div>
    <div class="def-content">
      <div class="def-label">Définition</div>
      <p class="def-text">
        Un DISP est une entité qui agit en tant qu'<strong>intermédiaire neutre</strong> entre des <strong>détenteurs de données</strong> (<em>data holders</em>) et des <strong>utilisateurs de données</strong> (<em>data users</em>), facilitant l'échange ou la mise en commun de données <strong>sans les exploiter à son propre compte</strong>. Il peut prendre la forme d'une place de marché de données, d'un gestionnaire d'espace de données sectoriel ou d'une plateforme de data sharing B2B / B2C.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- RÔLES -->

  <div class="section-title animate d2">Acteurs & flux</div>
  <div class="roles-grid animate d3">
    <div class="role-card holder">
      <div class="role-icon">🏦</div>
      <div class="role-name">Data Holder</div>
      <div class="role-title">Détenteur de données</div>
      <p class="role-desc">Entité (entreprise, administation, individu) disposant de données et souhaitant les mettre à disposition sous conditions maîtrisées.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="role-card disp">
      <div class="role-icon">⚡</div>
      <div class="role-name">DISP</div>
      <div class="role-title">Intermédiaire neutre</div>
      <p class="role-desc">Orchestre le partage, applique les règles d'usage, garantit la neutralité. Enregistré auprès d'une autorité compétente nationale.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="role-card user">
      <div class="role-icon">🔬</div>
      <div class="role-name">Data User</div>
      <div class="role-title">Utilisateur de données</div>
      <p class="role-desc">Entité accédant aux données pour produire des services, analyses, innovations — selon les droits accordés par le holder.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- OBLIGATIONS DGA -->

  <div class="section-title animate d3">Obligations clés — Data Governance Act</div>
  <div class="obligations-grid animate d3">
    <div class="obligation">
      <div class="ob-number">01</div>
      <div>
        <div class="ob-title">Neutralité stricte</div>
        <p class="ob-desc">Le DISP ne peut pas utiliser les données échangées à ses propres fins. Interdiction de monétisation parallèle ou de profilage.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="obligation">
      <div class="ob-number">02</div>
      <div>
        <div class="ob-title">Non-discrimination</div>
        <p class="ob-desc">Conditions d'accès identiques pour tous les participants. Pas de traitement préférentiel entre data holders ou users.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="obligation">
      <div class="ob-number">03</div>
      <div>
        <div class="ob-title">Transparence</div>
        <p class="ob-desc">Publication obligatoire des conditions tarifaires, des finalités, des mécanismes de sécurité et des algorithmes de mise en relation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="obligation">
      <div class="ob-number">04</div>
      <div>
        <div class="ob-title">Séparation des activités</div>
        <p class="ob-desc">Interdiction de cumuler le rôle d'intermédiaire avec celui d'utilisateur de données dans des marchés connexes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="obligation">
      <div class="ob-number">05</div>
      <div>
        <div class="ob-title">Interopérabilité</div>
        <p class="ob-desc">Formats ouverts obligatoires. Portabilité des données garantie. Standards communs pour faciliter le changement de prestataire.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="obligation">
      <div class="ob-number">06</div>
      <div>
        <div class="ob-title">Enregistrement obligatoire</div>
        <p class="ob-desc">Notification à une autorité nationale compétente. Inscription au registre européen centralisé de la Commission, valable UE entière.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- LANDSCAPE RÉGLEMENTAIRE -->

  <div class="section-title animate d4">Écosystème réglementaire</div>
  <table class="reg-table animate d4">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Texte</th>
        <th>Catégorie</th>
        <th>Rôle pour les DISPs</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>
          <div class="reg-name">DGA — Rèq. 2022/868</div>
          <div class="reg-full">Data Governance Act</div>
        </td>
        <td><span class="reg-tag tag-fondateur">Fondateur</span></td>
        <td>Texte constitutif : définit les DISPs, leurs obligations, la procédure d'enregistrement et le registre européen.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>
          <div class="reg-name">Data Act 2023</div>
          <div class="reg-full">Rèq. 2023/2854</div>
        </td>
        <td><span class="reg-tag tag-acces">Accès aux données</span></td>
        <td>Droits d'accès aux données IoT, partage B2B/B2G obligatoire dans certains secteurs — flux à orchestrer par les DISPs.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>
          <div class="reg-name">RGPD</div>
          <div class="reg-full">Rèq. 2016/679</div>
        </td>
        <td><span class="reg-tag tag-protection">Protection données</span></td>
        <td>S'applique dès que des données personnelles transitent via un DISP. Bases légales, consentement, transferts internationaux.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>
          <div class="reg-name">AI Act 2024</div>
          <div class="reg-full">Rèq. 2024/1689</div>
        </td>
        <td><span class="reg-tag tag-ia">Intelligence Artificielle</span></td>
        <td>Gouvernance des données d'entraînement IA. Pertinent si le DISP alimente des systèmes d'IA à haut risque.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>
          <div class="reg-name">NIS2 / DORA</div>
          <div class="reg-full">Dir. 2022/2555 · Rèq. 2022/2554</div>
        </td>
        <td><span class="reg-tag tag-cyber">Cybersécurité</span></td>
        <td>Obligations de cybersécurité pour les infrastructures de données critiques et le secteur financier.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>
          <div class="reg-name">eIDAS 2</div>
          <div class="reg-full">Rèq. 2024/1183</div>
        </td>
